      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get that, but i'm not really looking for a doctor visit right now, just trying to do some self-optimization at home. i already looked up some of the higher doses people use for optimization, like 100mg or even 200mg a day. if i'm just trying to boost my levels for energy, is there a specific daily amount that's considered a \"loading dose\" for quick results? i just want to know what's a typical high-end dose for someone trying to get ahead of fatigue.",
